          "component": "rich_text",
          "content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Hostellites of The Aga Khan University celebrated Chaand Raat in a grand manner with an event on Friday, April 21st, 2023 at the School of Nursing and Midwifery Hostel. The event was organized by the Hostel Management, led by Mehrunnissa Kabani, Manager - Office of the Registrar, and saw active participation from students across all campuses."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Chand Raat event at The Aga Khan University was a festive affair, with a variety of activities and entertainment lined up for the attendees. Food stalls were a major highlight of the event, with delicious treats and snacks available for everyone to enjoy. What made these food stalls even more special was that some of them were arranged by beneficiaries of Aga Khan Social Welfare Board and Pakistan Girl Guide Association for fundraising objectives. This unique initiative aimed to not only celebrate the happiness of Eid Al Fitr with unity but also to help the community members who are facing hardships."
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "In addition to the food stalls, the Chand Raat event also featured Mehndi arrangements, music, and traditional performances by the students. The atmosphere was vibrant and festive, with students showcasing their talents and adding to the overall excitement of the event. The event was a perfect blend of celebration, entertainment, and community involvement, creating a memorable experience for everyone."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The organization and execution of the Chand Raat event was a collective effort, with students actively participating in the planning and arrangements. The students' enthusiasm and zeal were evident in their active involvement in every aspect of the event, from conceptualization to execution. The event was a true reflection of the spirit of community and togetherness that is an integral part of the Eid celebrations."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The event was a huge success, with students from all campuses appreciating the arrangements and actively participating in the festivities. It was a night filled with joy, laughter, and camaraderie as the Hostellites celebrated the end of Ramadan and welcomed Eid Al Fitr the next day."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
